  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Banco Mundo Mujer: Loan to Increase Financing for Microenterprises in Colombia</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The transaction consists of the granting of an unsecured senior loan to Banco Mundo Mujer S.A. (&#x201c;Banco Mundo Mujer,&#x201d; &#x201c;BMM,&#x201d; or the &#x201c;Bank&#x201d;) by BID Invest, structured as follows: (i) Committed Tranche I, for an amount of up to COP120,000 million; (ii) Uncommitted Tranche II, for an amount of up to COP70,000 million; and (iii) a potential parallel loan for an amount of up to COP80,000 million to be disbursed by another lender (the &#x201c;Financing&#x201d;).The Financing will have a term of up to six years, with each tranche having a term of up to three years from its disbursement and a one-year grace period on principal. The resources from the Financing will be used to increase access to financing for microenterprises, including those owned or led by women.</narrative>
  </description>
